  "body": "## Changelog   \n### ✨ Features   \n* **feat(autoflow):** add autoflow workflow cancel ([86ff6c5d](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/86ff6c5d)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n* **feat(autoflow):** add autoflow workflow get ([33ab6e14](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/33ab6e14)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n* **feat(autoflow):** add autoflow workflow send ([8d27dd6b](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/8d27dd6b)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n* **feat(autoflow):** add autoflow workflow start ([beba5177](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/beba5177)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n* **feat(autoflow):** connect to a local AutoFlow service without TLS ([9d82a5af](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/9d82a5af)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n* **feat(autoflow):** default the namespace to the token's organization ([50a9780e](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/50a9780e)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n* **feat(autoflow):** pass keyword arguments and channels to workflow start ([bd28f3eb](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/bd28f3eb)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n### 🔧 Maintenance   \n* **chore(codeowners):** add Relay maintainers as co-owners of the AutoFlow code ([b5cc7daa](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/b5cc7daa)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n* **refactor(api):** make the token exchange audience a parameter ([a8eabb4d](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/a8eabb4d)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->   \n* **refactor(cmdutils):** add a flag that reads a secret from a file or the environment ([548abd5f](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/commit/548abd5f)) by Timo Furrer<!--team-->\n\n",
